["<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Was I wrong about open models &amp; cyber risks? open-weight model offense-defense balance sigmoid ClickFix\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-30-interconnects-被渲染成网络武器的开源模型发布后-世界并没有崩溃/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/e4c5ea11768e1209-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"I\"><span class=\"dur\">9:47</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Interconnects</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1030</span></div>\n<h2>被渲染成网络武器的开源模型发布后，世界并没有崩溃</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">开源模型跨过了被认为的网络武器门槛一个多月，没有证据显示发生了质变级灾难，但作者承认这仍将是一场代价不低的行业被迫升级。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">开源模型</span><span class=\"tag\">网络安全</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Robert Caro – The master biographer reflects at 91 eminent domain majority leader\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-30-dwarkesh-写权力如何腐化人的传记作家说-美国建不成东西-是矫枉过正/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/210def115ef0731e-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"D\"><span class=\"dur\">1:01:10</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">Dwarkesh</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1030</span></div>\n<h2>写权力如何腐化人的传记作家说：美国建不成东西，是矫枉过正</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">他说如今的环评、社区委员会和诉讼并不比摩西那个年代的建设障碍少；真正稀缺的，是愿意想办法绕开一切阻力把事情做成的那种人。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">基建</span><span class=\"tag\">权力与治理</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Silicon Valley Walks the Jagged Edge jagged edge RSI (Recursive Self-Improvement) bullwhip effect golden path structurally short\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-30-asianometry-想做多算力-光囤芯片不够-不借钱加仓就是-结构性做空/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/de22d2d519cce16c-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"A\"><span class=\"dur\">18:57</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Asianometry</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1030</span></div>\n<h2>想做多算力，光囤芯片不够：不借钱加仓就是「结构性做空」</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">有人向作者解释，光靠融资买够算力已经不算真正「做多」——还得借债加仓芯片，否则就是在「结构性做空」自己，这是硅谷圈内流传的一句玩笑话。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>9</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">算力</span><span class=\"tag\">半导体设备</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Why AI Could Turn Small Law Firms Into Billion-Dollar Businesses contingency (law) plaintiff law cause of action ADR (automated dispute resolution) long horizon agents\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-30-a16z-小型律所靠ai也能做到十亿美元生意/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7b2f032532c3a865-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">53:14</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">a16z</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1030</span></div>\n<h2>小型律所靠AI也能做到十亿美元生意</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">原告律师的瓶颈从来不是案源而是人力：洛杉矶一家律所用AI把人均客户量从100做到500，这才是法律AI真正的市场。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">法律科技</span><span class=\"tag\">AI应用层</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Anthropic Opens the Kimono, Bubble Questions and Frontier Costs, Q&amp;A on Meta, Starlink, Brewers S1 neoclouds Starshield benefit corporation aggregator of aggregators circular financing\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-30-sharptech-anthropic的800亿美元-亏损-只是一场会计幻觉/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7a309a358a363994-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">1:38:03</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Sharp Tech</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1030</span></div>\n<h2>Anthropic的800亿美元「亏损」只是一场会计幻觉</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">这笔钱是亚马逊可转换贷款随估值重新计价产生的账面差额，没有现金流出；真正该担心的是训练成本的增速已经超过服务成本，且完全不受自己控制。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>9</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">Anthropic</span><span class=\"tag\">IPO</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"parent\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"“Everyone Else Has One”: What Your Kid’s Envy Is Really Telling You SIREN benign envy / malicious envy 시기 (Shigi) 부러워 (Puro) 장손 (Jangson)\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-30-raisinggh-孩子吵着要iphone-其实要的是不被排除在外/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/071e8b2d9bfabca5-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"R\"><span class=\"dur\">29:22</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"parent\"><span class=\"src\">Raising Good Humans</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1030</span></div>\n<h2>孩子吵着要iPhone,其实要的是不被排除在外</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">社会学家 Stacy Kim 说嫉妒本身是中性信号：你只会嫉妒离你够近、你也真正在意的人，学会不盯着对方而是追问感受本身，才能把嫉妒变成行动。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">嫉妒心理</span><span class=\"tag\">亲子沟通</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"PHP2Shell Won&#x27;t Be the Last Big AI Cybersecurity Risk minus one-day vulnerability centaur hacker formal verification Pass the Planet\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-30-oddlots-已知两年没人能利用的php漏洞-ai一天写出了攻击代码/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/dbb9160e6d589beb-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"O\"><span class=\"dur\">49:00</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Odd Lots</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1030</span></div>\n<h2>已知两年没人能利用的PHP漏洞，AI一天写出了攻击代码</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">PHP基金会两年前就知道这个漏洞，却因为没人能证明能利用它而搁置未修；AI一天内就写出了远程攻陷网站的完整攻击代码。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">网络安全</span><span class=\"tag\">AI安全</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"WHOOP CEO, Will Ahmed: 50B Hours of Health Data, a 4 Million Member Data Moat, &amp; the FDA Fight HRV GLP-1 AFib 510(k) ICP\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-29-allin-血压监测算健康产品不算医疗器械-whoop硬刚fda赢了/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/157d273f0c076aa6-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"A\"><span class=\"dur\">55:39</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">All-In</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1029</span></div>\n<h2>血压监测算健康产品不算医疗器械，Whoop硬刚FDA赢了</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Whoop坚持把血压监测算作健康功能而非医疗器械，顶住FDA一封警告信，最终促成FDA更新审批指南，血压功能至今仍留在产品里。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">可穿戴设备</span><span class=\"tag\">订阅制转型</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"What I learned about power from LBJ and Robert Moses public authority unanimous consent agreement YIMBY\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-29-dwarkesh-没人选他-他却靠法案里一句话把权力焊进了宪法/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/c00f9336512a8100-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"D\"><span class=\"dur\">24:42</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Dwarkesh</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1029</span></div>\n<h2>没人选他，他却靠法案里一句话把权力焊进了宪法</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">罗伯特·摩斯从未当选任何公职，却把征收通行费、留存盈余的权力写进了债券合同——美国宪法保护合同不可侵犯，这一招让他的权力比任何市长、州长的任期都更难撼动。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">权力</span><span class=\"tag\">政治操作</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Luke Muehlhauser on the most important AI safety work nobody is doing TEDAI neuralese reward hacking focused research organizations impact investing\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-29-eightythousand-ai安全圈不缺钱-缺的是愿意辞职去当创始人的人/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/c28893c5b3ed220c-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"8\"><span class=\"dur\">2:36:13</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">80,000 Hours</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1029</span></div>\n<h2>AI安全圈不缺钱，缺的是愿意辞职去当创始人的人</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">资金不是AI安全的瓶颈——会审查申请、愿意辞职创业去填补「AI的FDA」「AI的NTSB」这类机构空白的人，才是真正稀缺的东西。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI安全</span><span class=\"tag\">慈善资助</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"At The Money: Preparing for a Career During in Age of Artificial Intelligence prestige trap case method experiential learning\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-29-mastersinbiz-哈佛商学院前院长-学生该做的不是用ai-是跟ai辩论/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/ceeab3e81fd72a7b-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"M\"><span class=\"dur\">15:55</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">Masters in Business</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1029</span></div>\n<h2>哈佛商学院前院长：学生该做的不是用AI，是跟AI辩论</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">他要求学生在课堂上大声读出AI给的答案，再说清楚哪里同意、哪里反对——这种带着审问的协作，才是AI时代真正能带进职场的能力。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI与就业</span><span class=\"tag\">批判性思维</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"The Startups Rebuilding American Industry | The AD50 dual use valley of death co-engineering low mix high volume / high mix low volume AD50 manufacturing middle\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-29-a16z-国防订单替美国工厂买单-受益的将是机器人和医疗设备/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7b2f032532c3a865-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">50:21</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">a16z</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1029</span></div>\n<h2>国防订单替美国工厂买单，受益的将是机器人和医疗设备</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">国防合同替美国工厂矿山买单最贵的开厂成本，这些产能和工艺最终流向机器人、能源电网和消费品，而不只是武器本身。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">国防科技</span><span class=\"tag\">先进制造</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"Software engineering at Google &amp; CS education with Titus Winters Abseil AST readability review OpenRewrite zero token architecture\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-29-pragmatic-ai真正价值不是把活干得更快-而是去做以前想都不敢想的事/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/a3f9c9068b7bc84b-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:40:12</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">The Pragmatic Engineer</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1029</span></div>\n<h2>AI真正价值不是把活干得更快，而是去做以前想都不敢想的事</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">现有生产力指标只会统计代码行数和故障率，却量不出团队借AI啃下了一件以前觉得不值得、做不到的更难任务，这才是Titus Winters认为AI价值被低估的根源。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">Google工程文化</span><span class=\"tag\">大规模代码重构</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Taking on ServiceNow: Coding Agents the Rest of Us with Serval Co-Founder and CEO Jake Stauch TAM SDLC vibe coding ITSM\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-29-nopriors-ai-智能体越聪明-大企业反而把权限收得更紧/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/b4599cbd3b872acf-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"N\"><span class=\"dur\">38:05</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">No Priors</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1029</span></div>\n<h2>AI 智能体越聪明，大企业反而把权限收得更紧</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Jake Stauch 认为模型越强，权限滥用能造成的破坏就越大，企业只能把默认权限收到最小，再靠一层审批系统放行例外——这正是 Serval 要卖的东西。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">企业软件</span><span class=\"tag\">编码智能体</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"How Do You Take a Picture of a Black Hole? VLBI (Very Long Baseline Interferometry) event horizon black hole mimicker frame dragging\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-29-thejoyofwhy-银河系自己的黑洞太活跃-第一张黑洞照片拍的是更远的m87/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/b36fc769727aa196-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">59:45</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">The Joy of Why</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1029</span></div>\n<h2>银河系自己的黑洞太活跃，第一张黑洞照片拍的是更远的M87</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">银河系中心黑洞质量小、物质绕转周期只有半小时，一夜之内形貌就会变；M87黑洞重达60亿太阳质量，同一夜观测里几乎静止，反而更容易成像。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">黑洞</span><span class=\"tag\">天文观测</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"A Conversation With The Wealthy Barber (Dave Chilton) | #433 RRSP TFSA RESP AUM model segregated fund RRSP meltdown strategy\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-29-rationalreminder-自动储蓄的人不是以后才快乐-而是现在就更快乐/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/0e52c937f0d183da-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:21:20</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">Rational Reminder</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1029</span></div>\n<h2>自动储蓄的人不是以后才快乐，而是现在就更快乐</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">做了40年理财教育之后，《The Wealthy Barber》作者发现：强制自动储蓄不是用现在的克制换未来的安稳，而是让人当下就更少焦虑、更快乐——延迟满足的传统说法反而讲反了。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">退休规划</span><span class=\"tag\">金融顾问</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"The Manhattan Project, Take Two mirror imaging entity resolution RBAC/ABAC IL6 FinOps Genesis mission\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-29-chinatalk-美国政府的ai预算两年前就定死-却要追着算力账单跑/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7e7ccc037b1d3a98-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"C\"><span class=\"dur\">45:50</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">ChinaTalk</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1029</span></div>\n<h2>美国政府的AI预算两年前就定死，却要追着算力账单跑</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">国会拨款的预算周期要两年起步，但大模型和算力账单按月变化；真正的解法不是省钱，而是让预算能在不同模型、不同用途之间打通调配。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">联邦政府AI</span><span class=\"tag\">出口管制</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"What Wall Street Really Thinks About the AI Trade Now neoclouds pod shop / multi-manager fund frontier sink AI factor open weight model\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-29-oddlots-ai融资风险已摆在眼前-仍有四成投资者视而不见/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/dbb9160e6d589beb-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"O\"><span class=\"dur\">41:10</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Odd Lots</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1029</span></div>\n<h2>AI融资风险已摆在眼前，仍有四成投资者视而不见</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">巴克莱调查显示只有60%的投资者认为AI融资会出问题，但CoreWeave、Cipher等公司近几周的真实遭遇早已说明答案本该是100%，市场仍处在否认阶段。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI泡沫</span><span class=\"tag\">数据中心融资</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"Shadows, war, and finding Moomin joy GARM The Groke Moomin Characters Oy Limited\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-29-throughline-姆明的第一本书只卖了219本-真正让它爆红的是第三本/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/1646x1646+0+0/resize/3000/quality/66/format/jpg/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2F26%2Fcc%2F0e9f396b43a2b6ae03ba86b3f606%2Fd3ab8c80-c449-4882-8644-470d9f6df324.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">51:46</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">Throughline</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1029</span></div>\n<h2>姆明的第一本书只卖了219本，真正让它爆红的是第三本</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">姆明的前两本书是她在二战轰炸声中写下的末日寓言，几乎无人问津；真正让她成名的第三本不再直接写战争，却仍留了一个阴森角色提醒读者恐惧从未真正消失。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">芬兰历史</span><span class=\"tag\">二战</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Why SoftBank paid me 17 yen to skip the air conditioning demand response virtual power plant base load peaker plant stranded generation CapEx / OpEx\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-29-complexsys-ai数据中心全天候运转-芯片折旧比电费贵5到10倍/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/5cd9c21e737bb124-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"C\"><span class=\"dur\">26:44</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Complex Systems</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1029</span></div>\n<h2>AI数据中心全天候运转：芯片折旧比电费贵5到10倍</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">AI推理的芯片折旧是电费的五到十倍，比特币挖矿只有一点五到三倍，这个比例差决定了AI数据中心会全天候运行而不是像矿机那样为省电随时停机。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">电力市场</span><span class=\"tag\">虚拟电厂</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"Easter Island Moai Manavai Rano Raraku Pukao Tangata Manu Mata&#x27;a\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-29-ancients-复活节岛不是生态自杀-杀死人口的是欧洲瘟疫-不是滥伐森林/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/a572716032db7f6f-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:04:08</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">The Ancients</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1029</span></div>\n<h2>复活节岛不是生态自杀：杀死人口的是欧洲瘟疫，不是滥伐森林</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">欧洲人在库克船长抵达前四年已登岛，带来岛民毫无免疫力的旧大陆疾病，真正摧毁人口的是这场瘟疫，而不是岛民自己造成的森林滥伐。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">考古学</span><span class=\"tag\">太平洋史</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"Medieval Ghost Stories Purgatory Harlequin haunt Byland Abbey ghost stories\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-29-historyhit-新教没有赶走中世纪的鬼-只是换成了更凶的恶魔/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/06ac7e08f7ad2c21-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"D\"><span class=\"dur\">27:55</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">History Hit</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1029</span></div>\n<h2>新教没有赶走中世纪的鬼，只是换成了更凶的恶魔</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">新教徒说鬼魂是天主教迷信，但他们解释灵异的办法不是取消它，而是把讨债的鬼换成了更危险的恶魔——詹姆斯六世1597年写的《恶魔学》就是证据。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">鬼故事</span><span class=\"tag\">中世纪</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"718. The Suez Crisis: Britain&#x27;s Shattered Empire (Part 2) special relationship Eisenhower Doctrine lie doggo\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-29-restishistory-苏伊士战场英法完胜埃及-真正让他们撤军的是美国一通电话/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/e06c9ce2b8657d9d-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:16:31</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">The Rest Is History</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1029</span></div>\n<h2>苏伊士战场英法完胜埃及，真正让他们撤军的是美国一通电话</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">英法两天内摧毁埃及空军，地面战线节节推进，却因英镑在美国施压下濒临崩盘，被迫仓促下令停火撤军。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">苏伊士危机</span><span class=\"tag\">英美关系</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"408. JFK: Nixon, McCarthy, &amp; The Dark Side of Camelot (Part 2) Addison&#x27;s disease lobotomy Profiles in Courage\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-29-empirehist-肯尼迪意外输掉副总统候选提名-反而一夜成为全国新星/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/6dcfd4bf69c91d0f-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"E\"><span class=\"dur\">49:44</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">Empire 世界史</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1029</span></div>\n<h2>肯尼迪意外输掉副总统候选提名，反而一夜成为全国新星</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">1956年民主党史无前例地把副总统提名交给大会代表现场票选，肯尼迪虽在最后一轮惜败，却因此第一次成为全国瞩目的政治新星，还躲开了那年大选惨败的责任。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">政治史</span><span class=\"tag\">肯尼迪</span>\n</div></div></a>"]